WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
Burn a log.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.990
Where does the mass go?

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:07.370
The ash is much lighter.

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:10.460
But gases escape into the air.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:15.700
Catch everything, and the total mass stays the same.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:21.013
Atoms are never lost, only rearranged.
